# Mobile Testing

Test behavior, not implementation details.

## High-value flows

Prioritize:
- signup/login
- OTP
- onboarding language selection
- profile editing
- partner discovery/filtering
- connection request
- conversation list
- sending/retrying a message
- corrections
- block/report
- logout/session expiry

## Component tests

Test:
- user-visible states
- button interactions
- validation
- loading/error/empty states

Avoid snapshots as the only test strategy.

## Mocking

Mock network boundaries rather than internal implementation details.

Tests should cover authorization-related UI states without pretending the client is the security boundary.
